---
import { loyaltySteps } from './model';
---
<figure class="schema-figure" data-loyalty-build aria-labelledby="schema-loyalty-title">
 <figcaption id="schema-loyalty-title"><span class="figure-number">Figure 3</span> A failed build leaves the business question open</figcaption>
 <div class="schema-scene">
  <p class="schema-kind">Illustrative loyalty-code variation</p><p class="schema-phase" data-phase data-live>{loyaltySteps[0].phase}</p>
  <div class="schema-pair">
   <div class="schema-box"><p class="schema-label">Customers · committed codes</p><div class="schema-record"><span>1 · Mina</span><span>TEA-7</span></div><div class="schema-record"><span>2 · Tariq</span><span data-code data-live>TEA-7</span></div><div class="schema-record"><span>3 · Edda</span><span>NULL</span></div></div>
   <div class="schema-box"><p class="schema-label">Unique index on loyalty_code</p><div class="schema-entries" data-entries data-live>{loyaltySteps[0].index.map(t=><p>{t}</p>)}</div></div>
  </div>
  <p class="schema-status" data-status data-live>{loyaltySteps[0].status}</p><p class="schema-explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">{loyaltySteps[0].note}</p>
 </div>
 <div class="schema-controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 3 controls"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 5</span></div><div class="schema-hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
 <p class="schema-caption">Separate from the shop’s starting data: the second TEA-7 is a deliberate bad assignment. The assumed authorised correction restores customer 2 to NULL. No order or payment changes.</p>
 <details><summary>All stages, as text</summary><ol>{loyaltySteps.map(s=><li><strong>{s.phase}.</strong> {s.note}</li>)}</ol></details>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../figures/stepper.mjs'; import {loyaltySteps} from './model';
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-loyalty-build]').forEach(root=>stepper(root,{steps:()=>loyaltySteps.length,draw:n=>{
  const s=loyaltySteps[n];root.querySelector('[data-phase]').textContent=s.phase;root.querySelector('[data-code]').textContent=s.second;root.querySelector('[data-status]').textContent=s.status;root.querySelector('[data-explanation]').textContent=s.note;
  root.querySelector('[data-entries]').replaceChildren(...s.index.map(text=>{const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=text;return p;}));
 }}));
</script>
